.bubble-stack
  - messages.to_a.first(2).reverse.each do |message|
    .feed-bubble.feed-bubble--ghost
      = message.text
  .feed-bubble.feed-bubble--directive
    - if !user_turn
      | Waiting for opponent
    - elsif phase == "draw"
      | Draw from the stock or discard pile
    - else
      | Meld, lay off, or discard
